Z||000001||007DOUG||05-11-2000||01:57 AM||||I was reading the reasons bidders backed out. <P>Gotta love the "emergency surgery"  reason. Must not have been too much of an emergency if you had time to retract your bid. The last thing I would worry about when I'm on the operating table is "Oh my gosh, did I cancel all my bids?"<P>Or maybe he needed the money for surgery, rather than the Holley scoop. ||||reg||12
Z||000002||lawrence||05-11-2000||12:18 PM||||If you ask me, cancelling an auction shouldn't be allowed.  I bid on that scoop and didn't retract my bid, yet 10 minutes before it was over, the guy pulled out because he wasn't getting what he wanted.<P>That's what reserves are for.<P>-L <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
